chmod - change file permissions

SYNOPSIS
    chmod octal-mode file ...

DESCRIPTION
    Use the three low digits for owner, group and other. Add 4 for read,
    2 for write and 1 for execute or search. Only the owner and root
    can change modes. On directories 1000 is sticky and 2000 inherits
    group ownership for new entries.

EXAMPLES
    chmod 750 /tmp/program

SEE ALSO
    chown(1), umask(1), statx(2)
